(   V * \(dE / dt\) = P - \( E * c * A / 4 \).) Tj
T*
(   - Rearranging:) Tj
T*
(   dE / dt + \( c * A / 4*V \) * E = P / V.) Tj
T*
(   - Let k = c * A / \(4 * V\). The equation becomes: dE/dt + k * E = P / V.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Solution for Decay of Sound \(P = 0 when source shuts off at t = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   - dE / dt + k * E = 0 => dE / E = - k * dt.) Tj
T*
(   - Integrating from initial steady-state energy density E_0:) Tj
T*
(   E\(t\) = E_0 * exp\( - k * t \) = E_0 * exp[ - \( c * A / 4*V \) * t ].) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Evaluating Reverberation Time T \(RT60\):) Tj
T*
(   - By definition, at t = T, E\(T\) = 10^-6 * E_0.) Tj
T*
(   10^-6 * E_0 = E_0 * exp[ - \( c * A / 4*V \) * T ].) Tj
T*
(   - Taking natural logarithm of both sides:) Tj
T*
(   ln\( 10^-6 \) = - \( c * A / 4*V \) * T => - 6 * ln\(10\) = - \( c * A / 4*V \) * T.) Tj
T*
(   - Solving for T:) Tj
T*
(   T = \( 24 * ln\(10\) * V \) / \( c * A \) = \( 24 * 2.3026 * V \) / \( c * A \) = \( 55.262 * V \) / \( c *) Tj
T*
(   A \).) Tj
T*
(   - For speed of sound in air at 20 C, c = 343 m/s:) Tj
T*
(   T = \( 55.262 / 343 \) * \( V / A \) = 0.1611 * V / A.) Tj
T*
(   T = 0.161 * V / A. \(Q.E.D.\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
