12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Describe the Magnetostriction method for generating ultrasonics. Explain the Joule effect, draw the circuit diagram, derive the resonant frequency formula, and state its limitations.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Magnetostriction Phenomenon \(Joule Effect\):) Tj
T*
(   - Discovered by James Prescott Joule in 1842.) Tj
T*
(   - When a ferromagnetic rod \(e.g., Nickel, Permalloy, Ferrite\) is subjected to an axial magnetic) Tj
T*
(   field, its magnetic domains align with the field, causing an elastic mechanical strain \(change) Tj
T*
(   in length Delta_L / L\).) Tj
T*
(   - The dimensional change is independent of magnetic field polarity \(elongates for both +H and) Tj
T*
(   -H\).) Tj
T*
(   - Consequently, in an alternating AC field of frequency f, the rod vibrates mechanically at) Tj
T*
(   double frequency 2*f.) Tj
T*
(   - To obtain vibrations at identical frequency f, a DC polarizing magnetic bias field is) Tj
T*
(   superimposed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

