(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the Acoustic Emission \(AE\) technique for continuous structural health monitoring of prestressed concrete and steel bridge girders.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Physical Origin of Acoustic Emission:) Tj
T*
(   - Acoustic Emission \(AE\) is the spontaneous generation of transient elastic stress waves caused) Tj
T*
(   by rapid localized redistribution of strain energy within a material undergoing mechanical) Tj
T*
(   distress.) Tj
T*
(   - Microscopic sources: Micro-crack initiation, crack propagation, rebar yielding,) Tj
T*
(   rebar-concrete debonding, and wire fractures in prestressing tendons.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Instrumentation and Sensor Array:) Tj
T*
(   - Piezoelectric AE sensors \(resonant at 50 to 300 kHz\) are coupled to structural steel or) Tj
T*
(   concrete using silicon grease and magnetic clamps.) Tj
T*
(   - High-gain preamplifiers \(40 to 60 dB\) boost faint microvolt signals above ambient electrical) Tj
T*
(   noise.) Tj
T*
(   - High-speed acquisition loggers record waveform parameters: Peak Amplitude, Energy \(MARSE\),) Tj
T*
(   Counts, Rise Time, and Duration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Source Location via Time-of-Arrival Triangulation:) Tj
T*
(   - An array of N sensors at known coordinates \(x_i, y_i\) detects the acoustic wave at arrival) Tj
T*
(   times t_i.) Tj
T*
(   - Time differences Delta_t_ij = t_i - t_j define hyperbolic surface trajectories.) Tj
T*
(   - The intersection of the hyperbolas pinpoints the 2D or 3D coordinate of the active growing) Tj
T*
(   micro-crack with centimeter accuracy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Real-Time Bridge Safety Assessment:) Tj
T*
(   - Differentiates harmless background traffic vibration from catastrophic active structural) Tj
T*
(   damage.) Tj
T*
(   - Rising cumulative AE energy and hit rates provide early warning of impending structural) Tj
T*
(   failure days before visible surface cracking.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
